# Expo Go previews

Follow the "Expo Go previews" section of `/workspace/AGENTS.md`. In short:

1. Run `artifacts/same-same/scripts/expo-go-preview.sh` on the right branch. Only share the link if it prints `READY`.
2. Link: `exp://sw6cd7preview.exp.direct`, entered in the **Expo Go** app via "Enter URL manually". Never the SameWave app icon.
3. Tell the user to look for the gold `Preview: <branch>` pill. No pill means they are in the installed Play app, not the preview.
4. After the user opens it, check the Metro log (tmux `expo-dev`): expect `[preview] skip sign-in is ON` and NO `google sso start`. Also verify the render in a browser (web Metro on 8082 with the same preview flags) before claiming it works.
5. Keep the project on Expo SDK 58 (the phone's Expo Go). Use `expo-audio`, not `expo-av`. Serve on `*.exp.direct`, not trycloudflare.
6. Google sign-in cannot finish in Expo Go (the installed SameWave app steals the OAuth redirect), so the script sets `EXPO_PUBLIC_EXPO_GO_PREVIEW_SKIP_SIGN_IN=1`.
